{"id":"word:hebrew:H3957","type":"word","title":"לִשְׁכָּה","subtitle":"H3957 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a room in a building (whether for storage, eating, or lodging)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to לִשְׁכָּה (H3957) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 48 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"לִשְׁכָּה (lishkâh) means a room in a building (whether for storage, eating, or lodging) First listed occurrence: 1Chr 9 26."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"לִשְׁכָּה","transliteration":"lishkâh","pronunciation":"lish-kaw'","strong":"H3957","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3957","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["הַ/לְּשָׁכ֔וֹת","לִֽשְׁכ֣וֹת","הַ/לְּשָׁכ֑וֹת","הַ/לְּשָׁכ֗וֹת","הַ/לְּשָׁכ֖וֹת"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncfpa",15],["HNcfpa",6],["HNcfsc",5],["HNcfpc",5],["HR/Ncfsc",5],["HTd/Ncfsa",3],["HTd/Ncfpc",2],["HRd/Ncfpa",1],["HNcfsa/Sd",1],["HC/Ncfsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a room in a building (whether for storage, eating, or lodging)","usage":"chamber, parlour. Compare 5393 .","full":"H3957. lishkah לִשְׁכָּה noun feminine room, chamber, hall, cell, lishka (Late Hebrew id. לִשְׁכְּתָא ᵑ7 ; compare also נִשְׁכָּה ; on the lishka see Now Archaeology ii. 37, 52, 79 ; Bo Geogr.I, xvii. 438 (ed. Leusd.) compare Greek λέσχη , compare Rs Semitic i. 236 (2nd ed. 254) and elsewhere ); — ׳ל Ezek 40:38 +; construct לִשְׁכַּת 2Kin 23:11 +; with ה locative לִשְׁכָּ֑תָה 1Sam 9:22 ; plural לְשָׁכוֺת Ezek 40:17 +; construct לִשְׁכוֺת Neh 10:38 +; — 1. a. of room connected with a sanctuary ( בָּמָה ), where sacrificial meal was eaten 1Sam 9:22 , insert also probably 1:18 ( ᵐ5 We Dr Klo Bu). b. connected with Solomon's temple, where wine offered to Rechabites Jer 35:2 , 4 ; compare 35:4 ; 35:4 one where prophecy read 36:10 (both these apparently open, compare Gie 35:2 ); compare בַּמַּרְוָרִים ֗֗֗ הַסָּרִיס נְתַןמֶֿלֶךְ לִשְׁכַּת 2Kin 23:11 ; used of Levites' cells 1Chr 9:33 ; = store-rooms 9:26 (|| אֹצָרוֺת ), 23:28 ; 28:12 ; 2Chr 31:11 . c. in Ezekiel's temple , cells for priests, singers, etc. Ezek 40:17 (twice in verse); 40:38 , 44 , 45 , 46 + 41:10 (strike out Co Bthl), 42:1 , 4 , 7 , 8 , 11 + 42:12 (strike out Co Bthl); in three tiers, compare ׳הַלְּ הָעֶלְיוֺנֹת 42:5 (see 42:3 ), ( 45:5 read ᵐ5 לָשֶׁבֶת עָרִים Sm Co Sgfr KauAT Bthl ); ׳ל הַקֹּדֶשׁ for sacred uses 42:13 (3 t. in verse); 44:19 ; 46:19 . d. in second temple, as store-rooms Ezra 8:29 ; Neh 10:38 ; 10:39 (|| הָאוֺצָר בֵּית ), Nehemiah 10:40; used by individuals Ezra 10:6 ; Neh 13:5 ( ׳ל גְּדוֺלָה ), 13:8 , in General 13:4 ; 13:9 . 2 of scribe's room in royal palace Jer 36:12 , 20 , 21 .","rootNote":"from an unused root of uncertain meaning;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 9 26","keyReferences":["1Chr 9 26","1Chr 9 33","1Chr 23 28","1Chr 28 12","1Sam 9 22","2Chr 31 11","2Kgs 23 11","Ezek 40 17"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":48,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 9 26","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/לְּשָׁכ֔וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 33","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/לְּשָׁכֹ֖ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 23 28","book":"1Chr","chapter":23,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/לְּשָׁכ֔וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 12","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/לְּשָׁכ֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"1Sam 9 22","book":"1Sam","chapter":9,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִשְׁכָּ֑תָ/ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa/Sd"},{"reference":"2Chr 31 11","book":"2Chr","chapter":31,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְשָׁכ֛וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfpa"},{"reference"